      "text": "Okay, let\u0027s break down this Papua New Guinea Small Craft Registration form and translate its fields into your app\u0027s digital registration form, incorporating the multi-owner requirement.\n\n**Analysis of the Form:**\n\nThe form is divided into sections:\n*   **Header:** Contains the official title, Act reference, and the assigned SCA REGO No. (likely assigned *after* processing).\n*   **Office Use ONLY:** Fields filled in by the NCD staff during processing.\n*   **A - REGISTRATION:** Type of registration (New/Renewal).\n*   **B - OWNER\u0027S INFORMATION:** Details of the (single) owner.\n*   **C - BOAT/SMALL CRAFT DETAILS:** Technical specifications of the vessel.\n*   **D - REGISTRATION FEE AND SIGNATURES:** Payment details and owner declaration/signature.\n\n**Mapping Form Sections to App Registration Fields:**\n\nHere’s how you can structure the app\u0027s registration form, incorporating fields from the physical form and enabling multiple owners:\n\n**I. Registration Core Information:**\n\n1.  **Registration Type:** (Corresponds to Section A)\n    *   Field: `Registration Type`\n    *   Type: Radio Button / Dropdown\n    *   Options: \"New Registration\", \"Registration Renewal\"\n    *   *App Logic:* If \"Registration Renewal\" is selected, potentially add a field `Previous SCA REGO No.` to link records.\n2.  **Registration Status:** (App Internal Field - Not on form but essential)\n    *   Field: `Registration Status`\n    *   Type: Dropdown (Managed internally, potentially read-only for applicants)\n    *   Options: Draft, Submitted, Pending Review, Requires Information, Approved, Rejected, Expired.\n3.  **Date Submitted:** (App Internal Field)\n    *   Field: `Submission Date`\n    *   Type: Date (Auto-filled on submission)\n\n**II. Owner Information (Allow Multiple):**\n\nThis section needs to be repeatable. You\u0027ll have a mechanism to \"Add Owner\". Each owner entry will contain the following fields (based on Section B):\n\n4. 