ection List Screen:**\n    *   Query: `inspections` collection. Allow sorting/filtering by status, date, inspector, linked registration.\n    *   Display: List showing key info (Inspection ID, Craft Rego No., Status, Scheduled Date, Inspector).\n    *   Action: Tap item -\u003e `InspectionDetailScreen`.\n\n7.  **Inspection Edit Screen:**\n    *   Mode: Create (select registration, load checklist template) or Edit (load existing inspection data).\n    *   Display: Linked Registration info.\n    *   **Checklist:** Load items from the relevant `checklistTemplates` based on `inspectionType`. Display each item.\n    *   Inputs: `result` (Pass/Fail/NA) dropdown, `comments` text field per item. \"Upload Evidence\" button per item (uploads photos to Storage, links URLs to `evidenceUrls`).\n    *   Inputs: Overall `findings`, `correctiveActions`, `followUpRequired` toggle.\n    *   Action: \"Save Progress\" (updates status to \"InProgress\"). \"Complete Inspection\" (updates status to \"Completed\", prompts for `overallResult` if needed).\n\n8.  **Inspection Detail Screen:**\n    *   Query: Load single document from `inspections`.\n    *   Display: Show all inspection details, including linked registration, inspector, dates, status, findings, corrective actions, checklist results (with comments and links to view evidence photos).\n    *   Actions (Role-based):\n        *   *Assigned Inspector (if status \u003d \"Scheduled\" or \"InProgress\"):* \"Edit\" button -\u003e `InspectionEditScreen`.\n        *   *Supervisor/Admin (if status \u003d \"Completed\"):* \"Review/Approve\" button (optional workflow step, could update status to \"Passed\"/\"Failed\" if review needed).\n\n9.  **User Management Screen (Admin Only):**\n    *   Query: `users` collection.\n    *   Display: List of users (Name, Email, Role, Status).\n    *   Actions: \"Add User\" (create Firebase Auth user, then create `users` doc). Tap user -\u003e Edit screen (change role, isActive).\n\n**IV. Certificate Genera